holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":5,"title":"A woman massaging oil into a girl's hair","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":6,"title":"A woman kissing her daughter's head","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":7,"title":"A girl running away from a woman trying to oil her hair","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":8,"title":"A girl sliding and running across her house","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":9,"title":"A girl washing her hair happily","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":10,"title":"A girl happily shampooing her hair","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":11,"title":"A girl playing with bubbles and lather as she washes her hair","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":12,"title":"A man dries his daughter's hair","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":13,"title":"A girl runs away with a towel around her neck like a cape","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":14,"title":"A girl runs across the house as a woman chases her","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":15,"title":"A girl with wet hair runs across the house","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"},{"page":16,"title":"A girl dries her hair in the balcony","illustrator":"Barkha Lohia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2025"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p01.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಇಂದು ಭಾನುವಾರ.","ಶಾಂಪೂ ಹಚ್ಚಿಕೊಂಡು ತಲೆಸ್ನಾನ ಮಾಡುವ ದಿನ.","ಕೂದಲಿಗೆ ಶಾಂಪೂ ಹಚ್ಚಿಕೊಳ್ಳುವುದು ರಿಮಾಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟವೇ.","ಆದರೆ, ಅದಕ್ಕೂ ಮೊದಲು ಮತ್ತು","ಆಮೇಲೆ ಏನೇನಾಗುತ್ತದಲ್ಲ,","ಅದು ಅವಳಿಗೆ ಒಂಚೂರೂ ಇಷ್ಟವಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p02.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ರಿಮಾ ತಿಂಡಿ ತಿಂದಳು.","ಎರಡು ಇಡ್ಲಿ, ಜೊತೆಗೆ ಸಾಂಬಾರು.","ಒಂದು ಲೋಟ ಹಾಲು.","ಅಮ್ಮನಿಗೆ ಇದು ಯಾವ ದಿನ ಅನ್ನೋದು ಮರೆತುಹೋದರೆ","ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿರೋದು ಎಂದುಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಾಳೆ.","ಅಂಥ ಅದೃಷ್ಟ ಅವಳಿಗೆಲ್ಲಿ!"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p03.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["“ತಲೇಽಽಽಸ್ನಾನಾಽಽಽ ಇವತ್ತೂಽಽಽ!” ಅಮ್ಮ ಕೂಗಿದಳು..","ಅಮ್ಮ ರಿಮಾ ತಲೆಗೆ ಕೊಬ್ಬರಿ ಎಣ್ಣೆ ಹಚ್ಚಿ ಮಸಾಜ್‌ ಮಾಡಿದಳು.","ಅವಳ ತಲೆಕೂದಲನ್ನು ಬಾಚಿದಳು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p04.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ರಿಮಾ ಚಟ್ನಿಯಂತೆ ಘಮಘಮಿಸುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾಳೆ.","ಚಿಕನ್‌ ಸಾರು.","ಅವಿಯಲ್.","ಹಪ್ಪಳ.","ಮೀನು ಫ್ರೈ.","ಅವಳಿಗೆ ಹಸಿವೂಽಽ!"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p05.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಆದರೆ, ಅಮ್ಮನ ಒಂದು ಗಂಟೆಯ ರೂಲು ಇದೆಯಲ್ಲ.","ಒಂದು ಗಂಟೆ ಕೊಬ್ಬರಿ ಎಣ್ಣೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ತಲೆ ನೆನೆಯಬೇಕು.","ಅದೇನು ವಾಸನೆಯಪ್ಪ","ಕೊಳಕೊಳಕು","ಜಿಗುಜಿಗುಟು","ಜಾರುಜಿಡ್ಡು","ಲೋಳೆಲೋಳೆ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p06.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ರಿಮಾ ಎಣ್ಣೆ ಮೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಜಾರಿಬೀಳುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾಳೆ.","ಪಡಸಾಲೆಯುದ್ದಕ್ಕೂ ಜರಿದು ಹೋಗುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾಳೆ.","ಅವಳೀಗ ಸೀಲ್‌ನ ಮರಿ.","ಜಾರುವ ಜಾರುಮೈಯ ಸೀಲ್ ಮರಿ.","ಅಡುಗೆಮನೆಯುದ್ದಕ್ಕೂ ಜಾರುತ್ತ ತೆವಳುತ್ತಾಳೆ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p07.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಅವಳೀಗ ಪುಟಾಣಿ ನೀರಾನೆ.","ಜಾರುವ ನುಣುಪುಮೈಯ ಪುಟಾಣಿ ನೀರಾನೆ.","ಮಲಗುವ ಕೋಣೆಯುದ್ದಕ್ಕೂ ಜಾರುತ್ತ ಸರಿಯುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾಳೆ.","ಅವಳೀಗ ಎಮ್ಮೆ ಕರು.","ಜಾರುವ ನುಣುಚಿಕೊಳ್ಳುವ ಎಮ್ಮೆ ಕರು.","ಬಾಲ್ಕನಿಯುದ್ದಕ್ಕೂ ಜಾರುತ್ತ ಈಜುತ್ತಾಳೆ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p08.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಅಬ್ಬಾ! ಕಡೆಗೂ ಒಂದು ಗಂಟೆ ಕಳೆಯಿತಲ್ಲ!","ರಿಮಾ ಈಗ ಶಾಂಪೂ ಸ್ನಾನ ಮಾಡಬಹುದು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p09.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಅವಳೀಗ ನೆಲ್ಲಿ ನೆರಳೆ ದ್ರಾಯಂತೆ, ಹೂಗಳಂತೆ ಮಗಮಗಿಸುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾಳೆ.","ಹೂದೋಟದಂತೆ, ಹಾಂ! ಬೇಕರಿಯಂತೆ ಕೂಡ.","ಶಾಂಪೂ ಸ್ನಾನ ಎಂದೆಂದೂ ಮುಗಿಯದಿರಲಿ ಎಂದುಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಾಳೆ.","ಆದರೆ…"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p10.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಯಾರೋ ಬಾಗಿಲು ಬಡಿದರಲ್ಲ.","ಸದ್ಯ, ಅಪ್ಪ ಬಾಗಿಲೆದುರೇ ಕಾಯುತ್ತಾ ನಿಲ್ಲದಿದ್ದರೆ ಸಾಕು.","ಅವಳ ಅದೃಷ್ಟವೇ ಅಷ್ಟು!"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p11.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಅಪ್ಪ ಅವಳ ತಲೆಗೊಂದು ಟವಲ್‌ ಸುತ್ತಿದರು.","ಒಳ್ಳೆ ಪೇಟದಂತೆ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p12.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ರಿಮಾ ಓಡಿದಳು ನೋಡಿ.","ಅವಳೀಗ ಜಾರುಮೈಯ ಸೀಲ್ ಮರಿಯಲ್ಲ","ನುಣುಪುಮೈಯ ನೀರಾನೆಯಲ್ಲ","ನುಣುಚಿಕೊಳ್ಳುವ ಎಮ್ಮೆಕರುವೂ ಅಲ್ಲ.","ರಿಮಾ ಜೋರಾಗಿ ಓಡಿದಳು.","ಅಪ್ಪ ಕೂಡ ಓಡಿದ."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p13.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಪಡಸಾಲೆಯುದ್ದಕ್ಕೂ","ಅಡುಗೆಮನೆಯುದ್ದಕ್ಕೂ."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p14.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["ಮಲಗುವ ಕೋಣೆ,","ಬಾಲ್ಕನಿ.","“ರಿಮಾ! ನಿನ್ನ ಒದ್ದೆ ಕೂದಲು ಒಣಗಿಸಬೇಕಲ್ಲ,” ಎಂದ ಅಪ್ಪ."]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/682474-thalesnada-dina/p15.jpg","width":3351,"height":2406},"text":["“ಅದೇನೂ ಬೇಕಿಲ್ಲಾಽಽ!” ಎಂದಳು ರಿಮಾ."]}],"wordCount":204}